Description: Quick file previews for Dolphin, Nautilus and Thunar
 Preview images, PDFs, audio, video, formatted documents, e-books, text and
 CSV/TSV/XLSX spreadsheets in a reusable window. Open Dzurkel Settings
 to configure the optional Space shortcut
 in Dolphin (26.04 or newer), Nautilus or Thunar.
